<title>USA: U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to watch - May 13.</title>
<headline>U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to watch - May 13.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>* Digital Equipment Corp sues Intel Corp alleging patent infringement.</p>
<p>* Danka Business Systems Plc reported fourth quarter earnings of $0.33 per American Depositary Receipt, up from $0.28 for the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>* Apple Computer Inc's new operating system, to be demonstrated this week, is a key to its survival strategy -- Wall Street Journal.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
